@nsobid-4B159F0F7A360669738390EE8657B4F0
// Astral Chain v1.0.1, applied after Dynamic-FPS 1.0.1.pchtxt (native_trace --patch, in that order).
//
// Dynamic-FPS limits the frame step to 2 ticks of 1/30 s. A frame that takes longer (a shader built for the first
// time, a streaming stall) loses the rest, while the audio plays on in real time: cutscenes drifted behind their
// voices by the sum of those losses. During cutscene playback (timer flag bit 30 set: w21 == 0 in the mod's step
// code) the limit becomes 8 ticks, so a cutscene catches up after a stall of up to ~270 ms. Gameplay keeps 2.
//
// 0xA0E7F8 held "fmov s1,#2" (the maximum step) in the mod's code cave; it branches to 4 new words after the cave's
// last one (0xA0EFD0), still inside the executable page that ends the text segment.

@flag offset_shift 0x100

// Cut ends (0x8C2420, per-frame cutscene timeline update; [x19] = cut, [x19+4] = time in cut, w24 = cut length,
// s8 = step). The game ends a cut by clamping its time to (length - step) once, then moving to the next cut at time 0.
// With the original fixed step of 1.0 that loses nothing. With measured, slightly varying steps the clamp fires and
// discards up to about half a frame at each cut, so cutscenes drift against their voices (Dynamic-FPS: "picture up to
// about 0.5 s off"; its v1.1 fixed it with 30 FPS cutscene steps, which looked smeared). Here a cut ends when its time
// reaches the length, and the remainder carries into the next cut. At a step of 1.0 this is the same as the original.
//
// 0x8C2548 ldr s0,[x19,#4] and 0x8C254C scvtf s1,w24 (a branch target) are kept; 0x8C2568-0x8C2570 become unused.

@enabled
008C2550 0020211E // fcmp s0,s1: time in cut against its length
008C2554 04010054 // b.mi 0x8C2574: still inside the cut
008C2558 0138211E // fsub s1,s0,s1: remainder past the cut's end
008C255C 770200B9 // str w23,[x19]: next cut
008C2560 610600BD // str s1,[x19,#4]: starts at the remainder
008C2564 04000014 // b 0x8C2574
00A0E7F8 F7010014 // b 0xA0EFD4
00A0EFD4 0110201E // fmov s1,#2.0: gameplay maximum
00A0EFD8 55000035 // cbnz w21,0xA0EFE0: not in a cutscene
00A0EFDC 0110241E // fmov s1,#8.0: cutscene maximum
00A0EFE0 07FEFF17 // b 0xA0E7FC: fminnm s0,s0,s1
@stop
